@startuml
title SHA Smart Home - Control panel connection recovery
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
participant "Control panel" as Panel
participant "Broker server" as Server

Panel -> Server : PING
Server --> Panel : PONG

... Connection lost ...

Panel -> Panel : Detect I/O failure and close session
note left of Panel
  A sensor read can be retried.
  If a read fails after retries, the panel
  can display the last confirmed value.
  If actuator confirmation is lost,
  the user can check its state after recovery.
end note
loop Background retries while the server is unreachable
  Panel -> Panel : Wait before the next connection attempt
end
Panel -> Server : Establish a new TLS 1.3 connection
Panel -> Server : HELLO_PANEL;1;owner-example;<token>
Server --> Panel : READY;1
Panel -> Panel : Report that the connection is restored
@enduml
